{
  "8": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bec5eb5cf6770657b8eede31f9e2864b6a9bc1ea04adc5ae5960096866f4ce17",
      "text": "Powder, loaded.\nMordhau!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "12": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4feb1c3e53d46868f684bb085f915f0b10bf7b5d79f1774a6919da555ebc59b2",
      "text": "From this moment, I, Rolf Zahn,\nresume command of this army!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "15": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:732c43f26ac720c38182fb430767a8bf14869c8b58337c070fe28a14f347d22d",
      "text": "Who'd have thought the cats still\nhad such strength? ...Lord Zahn,\nsurely such a royal decree—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "18": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fa5fbf70a9bdad11dffe8a67ce4f57156e73d814886b3e139d36e5ccc55cd555",
      "text": "No! Never! They chose to die today\nover dying tomorrow!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:734874ca5d0ba7124f6a77df4b29ca936015061c8226cd3270e444b20738a7cd",
      "text": "...If only the king hadn't chosen\nannihilation... If only he hadn't\nkept you from the front...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "24": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4d20b4fffa34871c1e72b731234f30f7d7ed89dd946bbb523eff980c3400a9f7",
      "text": "...We are the king's sword. A sword\nonly follows the will of its wielder.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "28": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:feec99bbd7c7e446d6048dffad8198f79ce2dba0111cb89de27c0eb8d61064a6",
      "text": "Now, soldiers! Follow me!\nVictory to the king's hand!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "36": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:09d1e260624bb41d1443b7ad28c8247fbb8bd7a1c7fef7e96558e7911aa841e7",
      "text": "............\n...The path I believed in is—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "40": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6eec1e26fd6e76848a75689cff009fc02483a0675c05c83f0e2b590d9041bcf3",
      "text": "Quit spacing out in the middle of the\nroad. You've gotta be used to this\nplace by now.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "44": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:93334e78177fda1d08cec050424fb43cc9a7dfe44edc5f615e038502a21f3a1a",
      "text": "Forgive me. The livelier crowds today\nhave somewhat overwhelmed me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "47": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:44fd18503a981d79a6992fba9d93320108c6e86d989fa216fa0d067ff94b498b",
      "text": "Brooding about something gloomy\nagain? Well, that's—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "50": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:65bac0bc934b5800ee187fef4ca2addf0a251eb96213cff059219727dc7ee117",
      "text": "...Y'know what, since you're here,\nwhy not lend a hand? It might\ntake your mind off things.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "54": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:41432eec70497f5bc584a1844bf0184ba7f01762c667def9054a1cfa310a25ee",
      "text": "Polar Bear Cookies. Hand these out\nto anyone and everyone, as\nadvertising for the shop.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "57": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ff9c19b19ac9fb605d14d38077dd87279997a2538dea143127db8ae8d4bb7fd9",
      "text": "Understood. I shall carry out this\nduty with all my heart and soul.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "62": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:400dc514e7af4af09bb8d3e1a3dbfcdd35f7092683fd6333ee766e5a154622f3",
      "text": "Whoa? I told you to clean up a bit,\nbut... you wear it well.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "64": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:feaa4df19d6078a9b9cf61b8aeb651cb289b70c24ec1bd59637141bbea5201ed",
      "text": "I never figured you had any sense\nof style.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "68": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1d128cf9589bb739a5d84fc7eb326eefa84e3d9cd83e4c2d934b00de40fcd63a",
      "text": "This outfit was a gift from my wife.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "73": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0bd8ce4a3609134984cd12befd08063077ea7dfe575b5d9e0233651c09eb4557",
      "text": "...You were married!?\nYou should've told me that!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "76": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f181b846153f44d2640563c4d9073b141b602b3980e5255338bacf57ca7db14e",
      "text": "It was long ago.\nShe passed far too soon, of illness.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "80": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d89dbf7dd9d79f2f7b0f5a956427797c41fe39c37b076b19f948c04b6f4d0eac",
      "text": "...I see. Sorry about that.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "83": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bb800c21aa81c4cbd540151773a39cacb2483ddcddec574645027c197877d8e5",
      "text": "No need. I was told it suits me.\nI am sure my wife is pleased.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "86": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f9f54491722b69840ddc40056bcb59e06c7750983fc0df26e60b4eaba8f2280e",
      "text": "Now then, Lord Klaus.\nWhere shall my battlefield be\nin this operation?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "90": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:17e3732ba04f84f954c2fcca919a54f9d8e496f07181c86d80ca08e86d6af222",
      "text": "Lord Zahn, ambush whoever comes\nthrough here. In the meantime,\nI'll hit the market side.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "94": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:80e30190fe8a7763844926a7f32cf7e41420bc244a0b050292dc0bf439e83bc8",
      "text": "As you command.\nMay fortune favor your arms.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "98": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4fe7965e6fafc290e703beb72a8813c024ce1626f948294cf8c3a9681a8d34e8",
      "text": "A sample from the shop there.\nMay your bond be blessed in the\ndays to come.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "101": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:42b1d2f7e35b239b52edf045778469aa4ecd517c7bdd583a3cec3953aecf8009",
      "text": "Take one, children. If you like it,\nyou may ask your elders for more.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "104": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cff957e2490cac1532d8e821e814a8abc8a5d1f0f29581e621ec236008f666cf",
      "text": "Drifters... Laughing together without\nregard for race. ...A fine town.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "108": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2a91e091d7efdc1c8871108bfe3bd57f6d19992cd9fb34a6617892fd05de90ca",
      "text": "...Lord Zahn?\nIs that Lord Rolf Zahn?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "112": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4ff64158252d4f04d6a20bf44d551c3529c3af1ccc5eb4ce34a74c51ffa8eedb",
      "text": "...Lord Paul? And those with you...\nWhy are canine officers in Palpebra?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "115": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:396678bc7f9f8aaa44d3505974192d9cc4a7c653a4f5cb04693b3e08342bca28",
      "text": "W-well, that is... um...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "118": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:097ac7aeed88ee755d6c719b9952492311cbcf7d8507428765abd8a242254e36",
      "text": "Classified, then.\n...So war is stirring.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d039132b36c79c1d70629f00aafd2f7bd54878ab50b677f8ab5632a92a9d93da",
      "text": "Mind going easy on the youngster\nnow, Mister Black Wolf?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "126": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:754288e27e48ddafed5e7ec7c8e0b3ff26c2c0005f6d2d07afef4a9d7315dba8",
      "text": "Poking a bush and flushing out a\nsnake, as they say. What a catch.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "129": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8a35e5d4e059e49aee0046ae3e71b682f367c197a4df6f18761bd2462011ddac",
      "text": "That's my line. I knew about Klaus,\nbut I never thought you'd be here\ntoo.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "132": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:684e6fff35c54bfb842f4877905204557bdbd4a65a203433ed11a062cd9ca7e9",
      "text": "This has proven surprisingly fun.\nI know it does not suit me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "135": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:391726810a74124c78619f1cdc41e23bfb6f68a32217d566b7fde24823214ec9",
      "text": "N-no, sir!? It suits you very well...\nI mean, um!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "138": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d4d56eda9b6dd8d796c51f8e106590f0683f25cf2a4cf6c3e79c3be2245ebe77",
      "text": "There is no need to stand on\nceremony. Now, a Polar Bear Cookie?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "144": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bf7b31903efe8b085eaf677c478a4a6284d0c6532ad3c591523ce494ae59912a",
      "text": "...It has been a while. Speaking\nalone like this, I mean. Not since my\nwife's funeral, I think.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "147": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:88327c62dbf6d51cb2f39699d04610a6d59210198952961371a5b261b1d9a8ca",
      "text": "That outfit. Gerda picked it out,\ndidn't she? I could tell right away.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "150": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:05e091e3531b8b9264261adf5bf4342cc1eb2c4c7f686c68d420a0eeae1ab695",
      "text": "...Gerda was a lovely woman.\nAlmost too dazzling for a\nslip of a girl like me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "154": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5d828c06e3b07873454d296750cc8a2cfd4fe92089adb2f53fbb68f742c8d8a6",
      "text": "...She was too good for me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "157": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:829ba76281028ea570680dada8cce9103bbeb5c8fbe3189af053952fe8609d9c",
      "text": "I could not even be at her deathbed.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "164": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:579ac02a858d78b7f9c3144d661758c943f2cc27678922dff7bd9525fe662195",
      "text": "Gerda!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "170": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bbbf8200e5e861b5329ee2cf812f3371a967d41a7029938773c259d31211a3a2",
      "text": "Ah, curse me... curse me...\nCurse this fool who weighed his wife\nagainst his soldiers' lives...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "173": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a7cbe9fa45bfdb875fad8fdfe7bba6bb94e9db92fc9e031fb7f26f5b279eebc9",
      "text": "...Lord Zahn.\nThese are your wife's last words.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "178": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e25663708cf7c35baefb3155abd164051624a6ac335607a7f29dd26bf04e4c75",
      "text": "'Walk the path you believe in...'",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "181": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fb836b1e7d2a0b445d76c17f61633fa06ef7b8276d256822fd3faeb4dc69729d",
      "text": "............\nMy path is...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "184": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:97b16ba2205e1ed74c944b24dec2db24e71e67e22e0d1f4ee9e908c7e42870e0",
      "text": "I wasn't going to say a word about\nthis now, either. But—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "186": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7af1954227b5d3ec12b7c7cb89cbcb2493374f1aeef53cff122507cd3519ad78",
      "text": "The ones who couldn't return to the\nranks. The ones who couldn't even\nenlist. ...They're trying to move on.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "191": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e92a37cd4c71269ed063b973ff8c5535c4497f3c3075623a39ad8f884a340308",
      "text": "...The answer was already there.\nThe enemy was in my own heart...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "197": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:45d8721d5b71e2ff0596a9f2cbcc90768b3d6d4705f7c0b0e73f1f5c31f2c137",
      "text": "Hey. I heard you were a big hit.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "201": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fe99ef1d73509ed0f61985604702662cc560bd590124b1ea9b90a9856316b795",
      "text": "It was a rare experience.\nI thank you for your consideration.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "205": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2b038087a4b4e3d1cc14d5cd83cf6cace469d982381ebcbb3a3b6475a7c41923",
      "text": "Uh... huh? Don't get it, but sure.\nGlad to hear it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "209": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:71c7a6587e8b9ef02fe677b9b05045ef9a82ce59374fd2751c51436808159a91",
      "text": "Lovers who speak of love without\nregard for race. Children\nlaughing and playing together.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "212": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:67f35b7000cdf6fe4222af1c7340ee2fbcd7ca4070ad64540fa54365c663e19d",
      "text": "...And old acquaintances trying to\nchange.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "214": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:89128c8f738d1ca4342dbfe52722a84b4bd2af6810cdebb4764620dedf3de86f",
      "text": "It made me realize that I, too,\nmust change. ...Though how, I\ncannot yet see.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "218": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2e63c08eec91cee01d1b5aee6bc73cd7abe6a7547336584790d7ddeeeb524693",
      "text": "...You're as dead serious as ever.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "222": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:10a2feb7de998e003f1b2b2f19706a6ff6ce7c80b3fbab2010e2ee57b201246f",
      "text": "I must thank Lord Klaus properly\nanother day. He even gave me\na gift for my wife.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "225": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:af656d534eb7e247a65492db5533528a3f786bc669837dedcbf779621cb27da4",
      "text": "Heh. Not bad. He's gotten\nthoughtful, hasn't he...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "229": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d3f040f2ddb280f3ea6aca608508039d5d9fefac86a5e5a25673a901c4569277",
      "text": "...Sir Nimbus. Would you spare me a\nwhile to indulge in memories of\nmy wife?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "231": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9a768e771929ea2f4540446456955738ebcb5e3cebbfe7b14b97fb93c9e7b92a",
      "text": "I am sure it will serve as a fine\nmemorial.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "235": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c93e671198e29331042f6f3eb2416be5795ba1128afd655aaebb1ae9da68d93e",
      "text": "............Oh, all right!\nI'll join you, if we can drink.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "239": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6e082681322c34ab267a77a8f64a6c5a5dfddccf6b79b3b473fcee77d54323d4",
      "text": "...How many decades has it been?\nI met her when I was still—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
